 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:48Z (RFD66606-1021) '- The migration rewrote all 29 rows to 8192 bytes each.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:49Z (RFD66606-1021) '- The whole suite passes with 78 tests.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-1021) '- The Lean proofs build and run under Lean 4.32.2.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-1021) '- `PhaseRat` bounds the significand, so binary64 does not round the algebra at this precision.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

